WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.034
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:04.236
You know, here at "Late Night,"
every night,

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:06.272
I deliver a monologue
made up of jokes

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.308
written by a diverse team
of writers.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.776
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:12.946
that, due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.647
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:17.216
We don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.051
so we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:21.554
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:22.889 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.424
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:28.160
Hey, everybody!
These are two of our writers.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.763
That's Amber.
That's Jenny.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.865
-I'm Black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:34.500
-And we're both women.
-Okay.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.803
So I'm neither of those things,
so here's how it works.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.170
I'll read the setups
to these jokes,

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.306
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.607
Here we go.

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:43.943
The Pixar movie, "Lightyear,"
was recently banned

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.278
in the United Arab Emirates

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.547
because it contains
a lesbian kiss.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:51.484
-Also containing a lesbian kiss,
most bachelorette parties.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.586
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.588
-The African-American Museum
of Iowa

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.924
is planning
a $5 million renovation.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.792
-That's how much it costs
to pick it up

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.728
and put it anywhere else.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.163
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:06.265
-A Mormon leader recently
called same-sex marriage

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:07.666
"the devil's work."

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:10.803
-Said lesbians, "I thought
the devil's work was makeup."

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:12.405
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.773
-Is that true?

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.675
-No, the devil's work
is underwires.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.010
-Ah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.712
-You know.
-They know.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.449
-They know.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:25.851
-The co-creator of the sitcom
"Friends" donated $4 million

00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:28.821
to the African-American Studies
department at her alma mater.

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:32.458
-But she needs to be donating it
to Regine, Max, Synclaire,

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.727
Overton, Kyle, and Khadijah.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.930
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.731
Seth, do you know
who those people are?

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.166
-I do.
-How?

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.734
-Because every time "Friends"
come up,

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.636
you tell me it's a rip-off
of "Living Single."

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.239
-It is, and I demand justice!
-Okay.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.773
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:49.842
In honor of gay people,
Burger King, this month,

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.178
released a special
Pride whopper.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.848
-And in honor of lesbians,
they released chicken fingers.

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:58.250
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.787
-Oh!

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.756
An investigation has found
that Black doctors are being

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.959
forced out of residencies at a
higher rate than white doctors.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:08.994
-And that is not fair
because Black doctors

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:12.465
also deserve the opportunity
to tell me I'm making it up.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:18.004
-Tampax recently revealed
that demand for their tampons

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.139
has increased by nearly 8%.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.842
-Which is great 'cause
they're usually in the red.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.543
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.543 --> 00:02:26.845
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:30.283
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:32.352
-Oh, I wish I could've
told that one.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:35.388
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.990
The first Black woman
to visit every country

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.291
has written a book.

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.827
-It's called, "Uh-oh!
It's Like This Everywhere."

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:42.962
-Amber!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.530
-Sorry.
It's called

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.566
"Why Does Everyone
Keep Telling Me to Leave?"

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:47.667
-Amber!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.001
-Sorry.
It's called

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:51.471
"All the Places I Couldn't Find
Hair Care Products."

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.373
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.274
-You know, Seth,
we love doing this segment...

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:56.742
-Mm-hmm.
-...but sometimes it feels

00:02:56.742 --> 00:02:58.377
a little inefficient.

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:01.514
Like, I tell a gay joke...
-Then I tell a Black joke,

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.248
and back and forth,
blah, blah, blah.

00:03:03.248 --> 00:03:06.052
-So, in an attempt to make
things more streamlined,

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.054
we found one person
who can do both.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.489
-Oh, you did?
-Yeah.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:11.958
Come on out!

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.058
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:16.495
-Hey, it's Wanda Sykes,
everybody!

00:03:16.495 --> 00:03:19.165
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.200
Thanks for being here, Wanda.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:31.211
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.079
-Hi, Seth.
-Hi. You ready to do this?

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:35.080
-Fire away.
-All right, here we go.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.785
The website Women's ERA
recently published a list

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.687
of interesting
conversation starters

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.588
for lesbians on first dates.

00:03:42.588 --> 00:03:46.225
-Conversation starters like,
"When can you move in?"

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:48.461
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:51.764
-A family in Canada was recently
followed by a black bear

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:54.199
during their hike
for nearly 20 minutes.

00:03:54.199 --> 00:03:58.871
-Said the black bear, "Well,
now you know how I feel at CVS."

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.606
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.606 --> 00:04:03.108
-That was great.
That was a lot more efficient.

00:04:03.108 --> 00:04:05.244
-Yeah.
-Hey, Seth,

00:04:05.244 --> 00:04:08.080
why don't you tell one?
-Oh, guys, I just shouldn't.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.281
-Come on, just one!

00:04:09.281 --> 00:04:10.949
-I just don't feel like
it's gonna end well.

00:04:10.949 --> 00:04:13.820
-Oh, come on, do it.
-Okay, I trust you guys.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.155
Ethan Hawke is starring in
a new thriller called

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:18.290
"The Black Phone,"
and like all black phones,

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.359
expect it to ring
during the movie.

00:04:20.359 --> 00:04:21.794
-[ Gasps ]
-Seth!

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:23.228
[ Laughter ]
-No, no, I --

00:04:23.228 --> 00:04:25.431
I can fix it, don't worry.
Let me try again.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:26.965
Ethan Hawke
is starring in a new thriller

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:28.167
called "The Black Phone."

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:30.035
"The Black Phone" --
pick it up if you want,

00:04:30.035 --> 00:04:31.737
but it's gonna be
a bill collector.

00:04:31.737 --> 00:04:33.639
-How dare you!

00:04:33.639 --> 00:04:36.542
-You all told me
it would be okay!

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:38.877
-You should be ashamed
of yourself!

00:04:38.877 --> 00:04:40.513
-Black women and lesbians

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:42.848
and Black women who are lesbians
are liars!

00:04:42.848 --> 00:04:44.951
-[ Gasps ]

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:47.353
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:50.256
-We'll be right back
with Wanda Sykes, everybody.

